docs\api_reference.md:14:| `BlockNode` (abstract) + concrete subclasses | `TextBlockNode` (paragraph/heading/quote/listItem), `CodeBlockNode`, `ImageBlockNode`, `VideoBlockNode`, `BlockEmbedNode`, `FileBlockNode`, `DividerBlockNode`, `CalloutBlockNode`, `TableBlockNode`. Immutable; `copy()` / `toJson()` / `fromJson()`. `BlockEmbedNode` stores `embedType/data/fallbackText` for business-owned block embeds; `FileBlockNode` stores `assetId/name/size/file` plus `mimeType/downloadUrl/uploadStatus/uploadError`. |
